## ------------------------ ##
##    SET THE GENERATOR     ##
## ------------------------ ##

## Uncomment the generator comment you wish to use

## example single mono-energetic particle
#/myapp/generator Particle neutron 100. keV

## Flat neutron spectrum
/myapp/generator Spectrum neutron ../Spectra/UniformNeutronSpectra.txt


## ------------------------ ##
##     SET THE POSITION     ##
## ------------------------ ##

## default position is origin 

## to start from a single point
/myapp/setParticlePosition Point -25. 0. 0. cm

## to set the angle emitted at phi, theta, random
/myapp/setParticleAngles 0. 90. 0. # +X-dir

## ------------------------ ##
##   N EVENTS TO SIMULATE   ##
## ------------------------ ##    

## print progress after N events
/run/printProgress 10000

## nEvents to simulate
/run/beamOn 500000